    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Find the sum of squares of the first 10 natural numbers.",
      "options": {
        "A": "385",
        "B": "3025",
        "C": "285",
        "D": "405"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Formula: n(n+1)(2n+1)/6. Here n=10. 10(11)(21)/6 = 2310/6 = 385.",
      "hash": "cd396963beb505c7",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "प्रथम 10 प्राकृतिक संख्याओं के वर्गों का योग (Sum of squares) ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "385",
            "B": "3025",
            "C": "285",
            "D": "405"
          },
          "explanation": "सूत्र: n(n+1)(2n+1)/6. यहाँ n=10. 10(11)(21)/6 = 2310/6 = 385."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If x/5 = y/8, then what is the value of (x+5):(y+8)?",
      "options": {
        "A": "3:5",
        "B": "5:8",
        "C": "8:5",
        "D": "13:40"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Let x=5k, y=8k. (5k+5)/(8k+8) = 5(k+1)/8(k+1) = 5/8.",
      "hash": "c43d2aeec67e6620",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि x/5 = y/8 है, तो (x+5):(y+8) का मान क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "3:5",
            "B": "5:8",
            "C": "8:5",
            "D": "13:40"
          },
          "explanation": "मान लें x=5k, y=8k. (5k+5)/(8k+8) = 5(k+1)/8(k+1) = 5/8."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-003",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "The hypotenuse of a right triangle is 25 cm and one side is 7 cm. Find the length of the other side.",
      "options": {
        "A": "20 cm",
        "B": "22 cm",
        "C": "24 cm",
        "D": "18 cm"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Triplet is (7, 24, 25). Pythagoras: √(25² - 7²) = √(625 - 49) = √576 = 24.",
      "hash": "52cb2ba9e00870f8",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक समकोण त्रिभुज का कर्ण 25 सेमी है और एक भुजा 7 सेमी है। दूसरी भुजा की लंबाई ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "20 सेमी",
            "B": "22 सेमी",
            "C": "24 सेमी",
            "D": "18 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "ट्रिपलेट (7, 24, 25) है। पाइथागोरस: √(25² - 7²) = √(625 - 49) = √576 = 24."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-004",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "By selling an article for ₹240, a man incurs a loss of 10%. At what price should he sell it to gain 20%?",
      "options": {
        "A": "₹300",
        "B": "₹320",
        "C": "₹360",
        "D": "₹280"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "CP = 240/0.9. New SP = (240/0.9) * 1.2 = 240 * (12/9) = 240 * 4/3 = 320.",
      "hash": "6e9b56b6f3ac47dd",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक वस्तु को ₹240 में बेचने पर, एक व्यक्ति को 10% की हानि होती है। 20% लाभ प्राप्त करने के लिए उसे किस कीमत पर बेचना चाहिए?",
          "options": {
            "A": "₹300",
            "B": "₹320",
            "C": "₹360",
            "D": "₹280"
          },
          "explanation": "CP = 240/0.9. नया SP = (240/0.9) * 1.2 = 240 * (12/9) = 240 * 4/3 = 320."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-005",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "A number is decreased by 20% and then increased by 20%. What is the change compared to original?",
      "options": {
        "A": "4% decrease",
        "B": "4% increase",
        "C": "No change",
        "D": "10% decrease"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Net change = -x²/100 = -(20²)/100 = -400/100 = 4% loss.",
      "hash": "0db8271ec7f0eabe",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक संख्या को 20% कम किया जाता है और फिर 20% बढ़ाया जाता है। मूल संख्या की तुलना में परिवर्तन क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "4% कमी",
            "B": "4% वृद्धि",
            "C": "कोई बदलाव नहीं",
            "D": "10% कमी"
          },
          "explanation": "शुद्ध परिवर्तन = -x²/100 = -(20²)/100 = -400/100 = 4% हानि।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-006",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "If Simple Interest for 3 years at 5% is ₹150, what will be the Compound Interest (CI) on the same sum for the same time and rate?",
      "options": {
        "A": "₹157.625",
        "B": "₹155.50",
        "C": "₹160",
        "D": "₹152.50"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "SI = 150, R=5%, T=3. P = (150*100)/(3*5) = 1000. CI = 1000[(1.05)³ - 1] ≈ 157.625.",
      "hash": "079c666908546515",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि 3 वर्ष के लिए 5% की दर से साधारण ब्याज ₹150 है, तो उसी राशि पर उसी दर और समय के लिए चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज (CI) क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "₹157.625",
            "B": "₹155.50",
            "C": "₹160",
            "D": "₹152.50"
          },
          "explanation": "SI = 150, दर=5%, समय=3. P = (150*100)/(3*5) = 1000. CI = 1000[(1.05)³ - 1] ≈ 157.625."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-007",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "Find the value of sin(60° - θ) - cos(30° + θ).",
      "options": {
        "A": "0",
        "B": "1",
        "C": "2sinθ",
        "D": "2cosθ"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "cos(30°+θ) = sin(90°-(30°+θ)) = sin(60°-θ). So difference is 0.",
      "hash": "66a090522d68bbfd",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "sin(60° - θ) - cos(30° + θ) का मान ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "0",
            "B": "1",
            "C": "2sinθ",
            "D": "2cosθ"
          },
          "explanation": "cos(30°+θ) = sin(90°-(30°+θ)) = sin(60°-θ). अतः अंतर 0 है।"
        }
      }
    },
