    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-009",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Angles of a quadrilateral are in ratio 3:5:9:13. Find the smallest angle.",
      "options": {
        "A": "15°",
        "B": "36°",
        "C": "20°",
        "D": "30°"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Sum = 3+5+9+13 = 30 units = 360°. 1 unit = 12°. Smallest = 3 × 12 = 36°.",
      "hash": "470da1d5a7e606d0",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक चतुर्भुज के कोण 3:5:9:13 के अनुपात में हैं। सबसे छोटा कोण ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "15°",
            "B": "36°",
            "C": "20°",
            "D": "30°"
          },
          "explanation": "योग = 3+5+9+13 = 30 इकाई = 360°। 1 इकाई = 12°। सबसे छोटा = 3 × 12 = 36°."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-010",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "The ratio of surface areas of two spheres is 4:9. What will be the ratio of their volumes?",
      "options": {
        "A": "8:27",
        "B": "2:3",
        "C": "16:81",
        "D": "64:729"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Area ∝ r². r1/r2 = √(4/9) = 2/3. Volume ∝ r³. Ratio = (2/3)³ = 8:27.",
      "hash": "6734a2caf42be514",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो गोलों के पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफलों का अनुपात 4:9 है। उनके आयतनों का अनुपात क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "8:27",
            "B": "2:3",
            "C": "16:81",
            "D": "64:729"
          },
          "explanation": "क्षेत्रफल ∝ r². r1/r2 = √(4/9) = 2/3. आयतन ∝ r³. अनुपात = (2/3)³ = 8:27."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-011",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "If (a-b) = 3 and (a²+b²) = 29, find the value of ab.",
      "options": {
        "A": "10",
        "B": "12",
        "C": "15",
        "D": "18"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "(a-b)² = a²+b² - 2ab. 9 = 29 - 2ab => 2ab = 20 => ab = 10.",
      "hash": "17642bf85dd37c15",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि (a-b) = 3 और (a²+b²) = 29 है, तो ab का मान ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "10",
            "B": "12",
            "C": "15",
            "D": "18"
          },
          "explanation": "(a-b)² = a²+b² - 2ab. 9 = 29 - 2ab => 2ab = 20 => ab = 10."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-012",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "A car covers 240 km in 4 hours. If it increases speed by 1/3, how much time to cover same distance?",
      "options": {
        "A": "3 hours",
        "B": "2 hours",
        "C": "3.5 hours",
        "D": "2.5 hours"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Old Speed = 60 km/hr. New Speed = 60 + 20 = 80. Time = 240/80 = 3 hours.",
      "hash": "0d45679dbdf045b9",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक कार 240 किमी की दूरी 4 घंटे में तय करती है। यदि वह अपनी गति 1/3 बढ़ा दे, तो उसी दूरी को तय करने में कितना समय लगेगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "3 घंटे",
            "B": "2 घंटे",
            "C": "3.5 घंटे",
            "D": "2.5 घंटे"
          },
          "explanation": "पुरानी गति = 60 किमी/घंटा। नई गति = 60 + 20 = 80। समय = 240/80 = 3 घंटे।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-013",
      "number": 13,
      "question": "A and B can fill a tank in 12 and 15 hours. If they open alternately for 1 hour each starting with A, when will the tank be full?",
      "options": {
        "A": "13 hrs 15 min",
        "B": "13 hrs 20 min",
        "C": "12 hrs",
        "D": "14 hrs"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "2 hrs work = 3/20. 6 cycles (12 hrs) = 18/20. Rem 2/20=1/10. 13th hr A fills 1/12. Rem: 1/10-1/12 = 1/60. B takes (1/60)/(1/15) = 1/4 hr. Total 13h 15m.",
      "hash": "715dbb044e59cd7d",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "A और B एक टैंक को क्रमशः 12 और 15 घंटों में भर सकते हैं। यदि वे बारी-बारी से एक-एक घंटे के लिए खोले जाते हैं और A पहले शुरू करता है, तो टैंक कितने समय में भरेगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "13 घंटे 15 मिनट",
            "B": "13 घंटे 20 मिनट",
            "C": "12 घंटे",
            "D": "14 घंटे"
          },
          "explanation": "2 घंटे में कार्य = 1/12 + 1/15 = 9/60 = 3/20। 6 चक्र (12 घंटे) में = 18/20 = 9/10 काम। शेष 1/10। 13वें घंटे में A 1/12 भरेगा। अभी भी शेष: 1/10 - 1/12 = 1/60। अब B की बारी (क्षमता 1/15/घंटा)। समय = (1/60)/(1/15) = 1/4 घंटा = 15 मिनट। कुल = 13 घंटे 15 मिनट।"
        }
      }
    },
